            <h1>Harikrishna Pillai</h1>
            <p>
                Master's Student at <strong>Technische Universität Dresden</strong>, Germany. <br><br>
                Love experimenting with Neuroscience and Nature inspired AI topics. Currently working on <strong>Continual Learning</strong> to create general and adaptive Neural Networks with <strong>Memory</strong>. Beyond research, I enjoy Game Development and 3D Graphics.
            </p>

            <div class="social-links">
